---
const updated = "14 September 2026";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Privacy and data use information for shandrov.ru."
    />

    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0f14" />

    <title>Privacy — Tudor Shandrov</title>
    <link rel="canonical" href={new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site)} />
  </head>

  <body>
    <main class="container">
      <a class="back" href="/">← shandrov.ru</a>

      <span class="index">PRIVACY / DATA USE</span>

      <h1>Privacy by minimal collection.</h1>

      <p class="lead">
        shandrov.ru is a static professional website designed to minimize
        collection of visitor data.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          The site does not currently use analytics, advertising or other
          non-essential cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Analytics and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          Google Analytics, Yandex Metrica, advertising pixels and similar
          browser-side tracking systems are not currently enabled.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Forms and accounts</h2>
        <p>
          The site currently provides no user accounts, newsletter
          subscriptions or contact forms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Technical server data</h2>
        <p>
          Web and network infrastructure may process technical connection
          information required to deliver, troubleshoot and protect the site,
          including standard server log data. It is not used here for
          advertising profiles or behavioral personalization.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>
          Links to external resources such as GitHub and Runer's Lab lead to
          independent services with their own data processing practices.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="updated">Updated: {updated}</p>
    </main>

    <style>
      :global(*) {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      :global(html) {
        color-scheme: dark;
        background: #0b0f14;
      }

      :global(body) {
        margin: 0;
        color: #f2f5f7;
        background:
          linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.018) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.018) 1px, transparent 1px),
          #0b0f14;
        background-size: 48px 48px;
        font-family:
          Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system,
          BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(calc(100% - 40px), 820px);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 80px 0 120px;
      }

      .back {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-bottom: 80px;
        color: #9aa7b4;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .index {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        color: #5b8cff;
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
        font-size: 10px;
        letter-spacing: .13em;
      }

      h1 {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 0 30px;
        font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 68px);
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -.05em;
      }

      .lead {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin-bottom: 70px;
        color: #c1cad3;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      section {
        padding: 28px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
      }

      h2 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      section p {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin: 0;
        color: #9aa7b4;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .updated {
        margin-top: 60px;
        color: #65717d;
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
        font-size: 10px;
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
